# ── Lead delivery (Resend) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# /api/angebot mails every quote request via Resend. Only RESEND_API_KEY is
# strictly required; without it the route returns 503 with reason
# "unconfigured" and the form falls back to a prefilled WhatsApp message.
# Nothing breaks; the lead just travels a different way.
#
# .env is not deployed. Set the same variables in the Vercel project under
# Settings → Environment Variables, then redeploy.

# https://resend.com/api-keys
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Where leads land. Must be a mailbox someone actually reads.
# Falls back to business.email in src/content/business.ts.
LEAD_TO_EMAIL=info@ga-hausmeisterservice.de

# Sender. onboarding@resend.dev works without a verified domain, but Resend
# then only delivers to the address the Resend account was registered with.
# To send from the own domain, verify ga-hausmeisterservice.de under
# https://resend.com/domains and use e.g. website@ga-hausmeisterservice.de.
LEAD_FROM_EMAIL=onboarding@resend.dev
